Package: drop-oss
Version: 0.4.0-360pc1
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 22), postgresql (>= 15), nginx, curl
Recommends: tailscale
Maintainer: EvilBob <spam3@360pc.com>
Description: Drop OSS — self-hosted DRM-free game distribution platform
 Drop is an open-source game distribution platform similar to Steam.
 It distributes and shares DRM-free games over LAN or the internet
 using a P2P Rust daemon (torrential) and a Nuxt 3 web frontend.
 .
 This package contains the 360pc fork with native (no-Docker) deployment
 patches, Tailwind CSS pre-generation fix, and bulk-import utilities.
 .
 Homepage: https://github.com/EvilBob01/drop
